      "title": "The Best Wordle Starting Words — and the Logic Behind Them",
      "description": "Why CRANE, SLATE and CRATE win more games than ADIEU. A clear, no-math explanation of what makes a great Wordle opener, plus a two-word opening system.",
      "image": "/images/wordle-starting-words-cover.svg",
      "slug": "/best-wordle-starting-words",
