      "title": "The Strands Spangram, Explained: How to Find It First Every Time",
      "description": "The Spangram is the master key to every NYT Strands puzzle. Learn what it is, why finding it first unlocks the theme, and exactly how to trace it across the board.",
      "image": "/images/strands-spangram-guide-cover.svg",
      "slug": "/strands-spangram-guide",
